DESCRIPTION:New Zealand-born comedian and Dungeons & Dragons enthusiast Ste
 ve Wrigley has been touring the globe for years alongside Rhys Darby. Now\,
  he’s bringing his unique\, D&D-themed comedy to comedy clubs all across 
 the country.\n\nJoin Steve for a hilarious hour of stand-up comedy celebrat
 ing Dungeons & Dragons and its incredible community. If you haven’t caugh
 t his D&D riffs on stage\, check out a sneak peek on his Instagram.\n\nAn a
 ward-winning Kiwi comic\, Steve has dozens of TV credits back home in Aotea
 roa. His debut album\, States of America\, is streaming now on Sirius XM Ra
 dio\, Spotify\, and all major platforms in the USA.\n\nCouples Package incl
 udes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n
 - Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent
  customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous
  to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/s
